1
00:00:00,102 --> 00:00:03,594
Strata returned zero volatility for an option priced at one.

2
00:00:04,852 --> 00:00:08,099
Starting at zero also made the solver's step limit zero.

3
00:00:09,352 --> 00:00:12,599
Reprice its answer: zero comes back, not one.

4
00:00:13,852 --> 00:00:16,326
Our candidate adds a positive starting floor.

5
00:00:17,216 --> 00:00:20,335
Volatility becomes about two point five zero seven,

6
00:00:20,554 --> 00:00:22,010
restoring the price to one.

7
00:00:23,268 --> 00:00:28,075
Eight hundred sixty-four failures fell to zero across seventeen hundred fifty tests.

8
00:00:28,966 --> 00:00:31,942
Synthetic inputs; customer impact unmeasured.
